                                                "sense_id": "23835d07-1278-3c5e-bdd3-79e3f161b541",
                                                "text": "These sneakers may go on this way indefinitely, or, if one of the big males somehow dies or disappears, a sneaker male's hormones will trigger a huge growth spurt and he'll metamorphose into an alpha male."
